  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in the bottom of a large clay or ceramic tagine or Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add onion and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, cinnamon, turmeric, paprika, salt, and black pepper; cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add lamb and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add apricots, prunes, and chicken broth; bring to a boil.",
